**BUSINESS REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (BRD)**

Project: Employee Commute & Corporate Shuttle Optimization System
Document ID: BRD-001
Version: 1.0
Author: Komal
Role: Business Analyst

1. Purpose
Analyze employee transportation operations and identify opportunities to improve routes, vehicle utilization, waiting time, delays, cancellations and costs.

2. Business Problem
The organization faces:
• Long waiting times
• Shuttle delays and cancellations
• Vehicle overcrowding/underutilization
• Inefficient routes
• Poor capacity planning
• Limited KPI visibility

3. Objectives
• Identify high-demand locations
• Improve vehicle and route utilization
• Reduce waiting time and delays
• Analyze cancellations and costs
• Monitor vendor performance
• Provide a centralized KPI dashboard

4. Scope
In Scope: Bookings, routes, vehicles, trips, demand, delays, cancellations, vendors, costs and KPIs.

Out of Scope: Real-time GPS, live traffic, mobile app and payment processing.

5. Stakeholders
Employees, Transport Manager, HR, Admin/Facility, Vendors, Finance and Management.

6. Business Requirements
BRQ-001: Analyze demand by location and time.
BRQ-002: Monitor vehicle utilization.
BRQ-003: Identify overcrowded/underutilized trips.
BRQ-004: Monitor waiting time.
BRQ-005: Monitor delays and OTP.
BRQ-006: Track cancellations and reasons.
BRQ-007: Compare routes and vehicles.
BRQ-008: Monitor cost per trip.
BRQ-009: Monitor vendor performance.
BRQ-010: Provide centralized dashboard.

7. KPIs
• Vehicle Utilization %
• Route Utilization %
• Average Waiting Time
• Average Delay
• OTP %
• Cancellation Rate
• Cost per Trip

8. Expected Outcome
Improve employee commute experience, transportation efficiency, capacity utilization and data-driven decision-making.
